1 0 obj<</Author(womenlovingwonderwoman \(The_Camel_Queen\))/CreationDate(D:20261101010317+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Teen And Up Audiences, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Catra & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Adora & Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner \(She-Ra\), Adora & Bow & Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Catra \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Bow \(She-Ra\), Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner \(She-Ra\), Angella \(She-Ra\), Juliet \(She-Ra\), George \(She-Ra\), Lance \(She-Ra\), Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner \(She-Ra\)'s A+ Parenting, Canon-Typical Violence, Hurt/Comfort, Adora \(She-Ra\) Needs a Hug, someone sent me an ask asking for a fic that matched this description, and i was like, shit if you haven't read it might as well write it, adoptee catra, adora has scars, i don't know what to tag, if you have suggestions for what to tag tell me, Child Abuse, Emotional Manipulation, Emotional/Psychological Abuse, Oblivious Adora \(She-Ra\), Princess Catra \(She-Ra\), POV Catra \(She-Ra\), for now, i have it all planned out i just have to write it, We're going Underground, half of this is just catra checking out adora, F/F, No Archive Warnings Apply, catradora, Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder - PTSD, adoptee trauma)/ModDate(D:20261101010317+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(bid my mother to bear witness \(won't be driven from my seat\))>>
