<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">bid my mother to bear witness (won't be driven from my seat)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Micah glanced up, realizing Lilly and Juliet both stood over them. Micah made eye contact with Juliet and she shook her head. There were no other survivors. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He reached out a hand to the little girl, â€œDo you want to come with me? Meet Glimmer? I promise Iâ€™ll protect you. No one will ever hurt you again.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The girlâ€™s eyes drifted up from behind her knees, one blue and one yellow, beautiful. She looked at the hand and he smiled. â€œPromise?â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;He nodded, â€œI promise.â€ &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or:&lt;br /&gt;King Micah finds Catra before the Horde and adopts her. She never meets Shadow Weaver and it's only years later, restless and wandering through the Whispering Woods, that she meets Force Captain Adora.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sometimes the fate of the universe can change in a single night.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>womenlovingwonderwoman (The_Camel_Queen)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora &amp; Bow &amp; Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Juliet (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>George (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Lance (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)'s A+ Parenting</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Canon-Typical Violence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hurt/Comfort</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra) Needs a Hug</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>someone sent me an ask asking for a fic that matched this description</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>and i was like</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>shit if you haven't read it might as well write it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adoptee catra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora has scars</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i don't know what to tag</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>if you have suggestions for what to tag tell me</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Child Abuse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Emotional Manipulation</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Emotional/Psychological Abuse</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Oblivious Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Princess Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>POV Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>for now</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>i have it all planned out i just have to write it</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>We're going Underground</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>half of this is just catra checking out adora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catradora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder - PTSD</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adoptee trauma</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
